# .handoff is git-text-only for COMMITTED state (capsule, cards, packet, active, history).
# These are ephemeral local runner control + scratch + logs — never committed
# (the durable signal is tasks/*.task.json + packets/latest.md + commits).
STOP
DONE
NEEDS-HUMAN
HANDOFF
work/
locks/
*.log
# ADR-0004 §3 revised 2026-06-13: per-repo ledger.db is COMMITTED and feeds the central
# meta/handoff ledger (federated per-repo ledger). Negation overrides the root `*.db` ignore;
# WAL/shm sidecars (ledger.db-wal / -shm) stay ignored via the root *.db-wal / *.db-shm rules.
!ledger.db
